window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-031-58232849326ea1cb.json"]={sha256:"58232849326ea1cb5c52f771b5283671f0074c8fc27794f8c47a10cd722e4e7f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-856df3e3986f0a20","url":"https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/","title":"Lustre parallel filesystems","titleEn":"Lustre parallel filesystems","publisher":"LUMI consortium","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-031","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-031","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-032","referenceUrls":["https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/"],"title":"Lustre：並行寫入的半開區間與重疊證明","titleEn":"Lustre: half-open intervals for concurrent-write ownership","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付條帶圖、映射與反向函數、兩個布局及 OST 排列反例，讓另一位學徒從物件位移還原檔案位移；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the stripe diagram, forward and inverse functions, both layouts and the OST-permutation control. Another learner must reconstruct file offsets from object-local coordinates without access to a Lustre system. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"輸入 writer_id、start、length、pattern，展開小型位元組模型並記錄每個位置的 writer 集合。","differenceEn":"Read writer identity, start, length and data pattern. Expand a reduced byte-level model and retain the set of writers for each position, distinguishing intended ownership from whichever write happens last.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["固定條帶模型中，槽位為 floor(offset/stripe_size) 對 stripe_count 取餘；物件內位移另由完整輪數與條帶內餘數計算；檔案位移 6 MiB、四個槽位且槽位從零起算；stripe_size 由 1 改為 2 MiB，不含 PFL 或鏡像布局；名義式 floor(6/1)-4*floor(floor(6/1)/4) = 2 zero-based slot；變更式 floor(6/2)-4*floor(floor(6/2)/4) = 3 zero-based slot。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","兩半開區間交集長度為 max(0,min(endA,endB)-max(startA,startB))；相接端點不算共享位元組；A 寫 [0,3) MiB；B 名義寫 [3,6)，變更寫 [2,5)；各程序長度均為 3 MiB；名義式 max(0,min(3,6)-max(0,3)) = 0 MiB overlap；變更式 max(0,min(3,5)-max(0,2)) = 1 MiB overlap。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For a fixed-stripe teaching layout, slot is the stripe index modulo stripe count. Object-local offset additionally depends on complete rounds and the remainder within a stripe, so slot alone is not a complete address. Use file offset 6 MiB and four zero-based slots. Stripe size changes from 1 to 2 MiB. The fixture excludes progressive layouts, mirrors and vendor-specific object identifiers. Nominal floor(6/1)-4*floor(floor(6/1)/4) = 2 zero-based slot; changed floor(6/2)-4*floor(floor(6/2)/4) = 3 zero-based slot. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Overlap length of two half-open intervals is the positive difference between the smaller end and larger start. Adjacent endpoints do not share bytes under this explicitly chosen interval convention. Writer A owns [0,3) MiB. Writer B changes from [3,6) to [2,5), retaining a 3 MiB length in both cases. Offset ranges are synthetic and do not describe Lustre’s actual lock extents. Nominal max(0,min(3,6)-max(0,3)) = 0 MiB overlap; changed max(0,min(3,5)-max(0,2)) = 1 MiB overlap. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-041","referenceUrls":["https://www.opencompute.org/documents/oai-system-liquid-cooling-guidelines-in-ocp-template-mar-3-2023-update-pdf"],"title":"OCP 液冷：串聯壓降與泵浦工作點","titleEn":"OCP liquid cooling: series pressure losses and pump operating point","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付條帶圖、映射與反向函數、兩個布局及 OST 排列反例，讓另一位學徒從物件位移還原檔案位移；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the stripe diagram, forward and inverse functions, both layouts and the OST-permutation control. Another learner must reconstruct file offsets from object-local coordinates without access to a Lustre system. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"畫串聯元件與壓力量測位置，建立 coefficient、unit、fit_range；不得把不同流體或溫度的 K 直接混合。","differenceEn":"Draw series components and pressure-tap locations, then record coefficient, unit and fit range. Do not combine coefficients measured for different fluids or temperatures without an explicit conversion or new fit.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["固定條帶模型中，槽位為 floor(offset/stripe_size) 對 stripe_count 取餘；物件內位移另由完整輪數與條帶內餘數計算；檔案位移 6 MiB、四個槽位且槽位從零起算；stripe_size 由 1 改為 2 MiB，不含 PFL 或鏡像布局；名義式 floor(6/1)-4*floor(floor(6/1)/4) = 2 zero-based slot；變更式 floor(6/2)-4*floor(floor(6/2)/4) = 3 zero-based slot。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","教學固定壓頭 H 與二次阻力模型為 H=(K1+K2)q²，因此 q=sqrt(H/(K1+K2))；真實泵浦曲線與流態需另建模；H=100 kPa，K 單位 kPa/(L/min)²；K1=1，K2 由 3 增為 8；名義式 sqrt(100/(1+3)) = 5 L/min；變更式 sqrt(100/(1+8)) = 3.33333333333 L/min。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For a fixed-stripe teaching layout, slot is the stripe index modulo stripe count. Object-local offset additionally depends on complete rounds and the remainder within a stripe, so slot alone is not a complete address. Use file offset 6 MiB and four zero-based slots. Stripe size changes from 1 to 2 MiB. The fixture excludes progressive layouts, mirrors and vendor-specific object identifiers. Nominal floor(6/1)-4*floor(floor(6/1)/4) = 2 zero-based slot; changed floor(6/2)-4*floor(floor(6/2)/4) = 3 zero-based slot. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","With a fixed teaching head H and quadratic resistance, H=(K1+K2)q², giving q=sqrt(H/(K1+K2)). Real pump curves, fluid properties and flow regimes require separate characterization. Set H to 100 kPa and express K in kPa/(L/min)². K1 remains 1 while K2 increases from 3 to 8. These invented coefficients represent an educational operating-point model, not an OCP product curve. Nominal sqrt(100/(1+3)) = 5 L/min; changed sqrt(100/(1+8)) = 3.33333333333 L/min. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-856df3e3986f0a20","url":"https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/","title":"Lustre parallel filesystems","titleEn":"Lustre parallel filesystems","publisher":"LUMI consortium","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-84367333215d0635","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/documents/oai-system-liquid-cooling-guidelines-in-ocp-template-mar-3-2023-update-pdf","title":"OAI System Liquid Cooling Guidelines","titleEn":"OAI System Liquid Cooling Guidelines","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
